  "description": "FFmpeg 8.1.3's shared libraries for osx-arm64, built for decoding plus AAC, MP3, PCM, MPEG-2, MPEG-4 and PNG encoding and common muxers (yadif, fps, aspectralstats, FrameReader's audio filters and TestMedia's sources the only filters; zlib and dav1d for PNG and AV1 linked in), so FrameReader and ShotDetector decode and probe in-process. https through the system's TLS (Windows, macOS) or OpenSSL 3.5 linked in (Linux). LGPL-2.1-or-later, as FFmpeg (dav1d: BSD-2-Clause; OpenSSL: Apache-2.0); the build recipe is configure.txt in the package, and sbom.spdx.json an SPDX SBOM of what's inside.",
